{
  "id": "DOC-18-T9d2ed",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2018-02-15",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:12 AM",
      "text": "\"Finally,\" Fenech said. \"We finally got over the hump.\""
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:13 AM",
      "text": "Garno had won 6 out of 8, including three straight, a dominant run."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:14 AM",
      "text": "\"We had to play a really good game to beat him,\" one said."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "1:17 AM",
      "text": "\"I thought I had him, but that SOB blocked my moves,\" said a frustrated Garno, stuck with a Q."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:17 AM",
      "text": "Emphasized “\"I thought I had him, but that SOB blocked my moves,\" said a frustrated Garno, stuck with a Q.”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:17 AM",
      "text": "Play of the game"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:17 AM",
      "text": "I dropped the Q"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:18 AM",
      "text": "Run the clock out"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:21 AM",
      "text": "A lot of momentum against Ben right now, sources say."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:35 PM",
      "text": "quick question"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Guys call Daniel Norris “D-No” right? Wanna make sure I have that correct"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:37 PM",
      "text": "Sweet. Knew I wasn’t crazy"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:52 PM",
      "text": "What's your tweet gonna be?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:52 PM",
      "text": "https://twitter.com/tigers/status/964312775555198983"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:53 PM",
      "text": "Nice"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:53 PM",
      "text": "I like if"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:53 PM",
      "text": "It"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:53 PM",
      "text": "But I wanted to be sure D-No was what was used, otherwise I would have just his name and it would have sounded awkward"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:54 PM",
      "text": "Yeah I get it"
    }
  ]
}